\f1\b\fs30 Description:\
\

\f0\b0 A classic flying saucer straight out of science fiction. Whether it's from outer space, a secret government lab, or a child's toybox \'96 one thing's for sure: it's an unidentified flying object.\
\
This model includes animated, retractable landing gear and supports emissive lighting to simulate glowing lights, perfect for night scenes or space environments.\
\
The UFO consists of 5 meshes: the saucer and four landing gears. It comes with simple animation clips to extract and retract the landing gears.\
\
